# AgentFlight CLI

AgentFlight CLI is a lightweight auditing tool designed to monitor autonomous AI coding agents. It ensures that AI assistants do not artificially pass CI/CD pipelines by deleting or commenting out failing assertions.

## Installation

```bash
pip install agentflight
